Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:04.27,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 比想像的還要糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.79,0:00:09.35,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 我覺得男生的房間像這樣也沒什麼不好的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.39,0:00:11.26,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這可算不上是解釋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:14.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作為妹妹可不能不管
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:15.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我來收拾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.39,0:01:51.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好厲害 一會兒的工夫就收拾好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.92,0:01:54.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芽衣妹妹做得好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.11,0:01:57.15,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把衣服拿去洗一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.99,0:02:03.57,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}管理員小姐 我能用一下洗衣機嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.71,0:02:05.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請用吧 在這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.39,0:02:06.81,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}謝謝您了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.08,0:02:08.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真能幹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.78,0:02:12.40,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那件事還是瞞著她比較好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:13.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那件事？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:15.07,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:19.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}春原同學愛著岡崎同學這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.13,0:02:23.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那…那是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.95,0:02:26.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哥哥和岡崎哥是戀人？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:29.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是的 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:33.34,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是春原同學單方面地發動攻勢…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:37.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 把不能說的話全都說出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:39.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}受打擊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.27,0:02:43.71,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 我覺得愛的形式各有不同
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.07,0:02:48.79,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}誰以什麼方式喜歡任何人都是他的自由
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.13,0:02:52.82,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎同學也說點什麼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.90,0:02:55.88,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 因為很有趣 所以就讓我繼續旁觀下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:03:00.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是拿哥哥沒辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.23,0:03:05.76,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請不要討厭我哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.19,0:03:08.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然他有很多的缺點
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.40,0:03:11.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但其實是個很體貼人的哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.17,0:03:13.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芽衣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.52,0:03:18.16,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請當我的妹妹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:19.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.05,0:03:23.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒錯 我也好想要個像芽衣這樣的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:26.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小渚和岡崎 你們在我的房間幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:30.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}難道說 要把這裡變成兩位的愛巢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.26,0:03:32.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才不是 才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:34.27,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比起那個 春原 有人找你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.50,0:03:37.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是個非常喜歡你的 年輕可愛的女孩子哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.74,0:03:38.35,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:43.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是春原芽衣 請多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.98,0:03:46.42,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼你會在這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:47.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是在電話裡說過了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:49.43,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我要過來玩了」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.54,0:03:50.33,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}電話？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:53.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}關於這個 我有話要說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:04:01.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是說 是你一個人在裡面瞎攪和啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.78,0:04:03.07,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是順嘴就那麼說了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:09.47,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好過分 我還真的相信春原同學喜歡著岡崎同學呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.57,0:04:13.04,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我特意買來的 白費了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:15.13,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想要嗎 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.17,0:04:16.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才不要呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:18.79,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小渚 真的可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:23.20,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我也還想和芽衣妹妹多說說話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.45,0:04:27.93,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然想讓你留下來 但不能讓女孩子住在男生宿舍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:30.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天就接受古河同學的好意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.81,0:04:31.45,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:36.20,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小渚 妹妹就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:41.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.13,0:04:42.03,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:45.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎同學 好久不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.17,0:04:47.33,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這位是？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:49.45,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 您真漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:51.35,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.51,0:04:53.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是渚的姐姐嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.78,0:04:55.64,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 是媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.29,0:04:57.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:05:00.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼了 真是熱鬧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.87,0:05:04.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 媽媽 我有一個請求
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.98,0:05:06.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這麼正式幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.53,0:05:09.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望我告訴你屁股上留下的傷痕的祕密嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:11.44,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:14.56,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有這種傷痕嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.71,0:05:16.07,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:19.04,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想確認一下的話爸爸就來幫你看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.10,0:05:20.97,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸真是好色
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.99,0:05:24.26,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已經不是能讓爸爸看那個的年齡了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:26.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}秋生已經被討厭了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.48,0:05:29.56,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以說女兒就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:32.75,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是媽媽的話 看一下也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.95,0:05:35.45,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望媽媽幫我確認一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.59,0:05:37.39,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒事的 渚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:40.17,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為從一開始就不存在那種傷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.18,0:05:44.44,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸又說謊了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:48.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這就是我用來解除交流不足的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:50.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}關係真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.23,0:05:53.93,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很厲害吧 這就是這個家庭著名的白痴對話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:56.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 忘記了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:57.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芽衣妹妹 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.97,0:06:00.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這位是春原芽衣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.53,0:06:03.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我朋友的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:06.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望能讓她住在我們家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:09.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫春原芽衣 請多多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.40,0:06:13.19,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫早苗 請多多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:17.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫秋生 這附近沒有能比得上我的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.76,0:06:21.82,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早苗阿姨很漂亮 秋生叔叔也很帥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:23.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是個乖孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.61,0:06:25.38,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}給你十萬日元的零用錢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:26.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大叔你太過慷慨了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:30.08,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哥哥想要打籃球比賽？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:34.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 為了我而努力著
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.27,0:06:36.17,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.21,0:06:38.63,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能讓我住到那個時候嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.67,0:06:41.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們是無所謂的 但學校呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.25,0:06:44.47,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒關係的 因為現在是考完試的假期
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:48.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也為了芽衣妹妹更加努力吧 岡崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:51.57,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然如此就只好拼一把了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:06:58.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}智代
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:00.98,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:02.88,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}馬上就打預備鈴了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:05.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然想成為學生會會長 不要遲到比較好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:08.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倒是你為什麼還這麼悠閒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.33,0:07:10.15,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是不良少年 所以沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.65,0:07:12.35,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒這種道理吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.25,0:07:17.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我在一起就不允許你遲到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:21.08,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 等一下 放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:23.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又有新的女生出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:26.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她要來看比賽嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:29.33,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣一來就更加不能輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:32.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能讓芽衣看到你出糗的樣子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.23,0:07:37.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渚是運動白癡 我又抬不起右手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:39.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}需要一個強力的幫手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.82,0:07:41.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幫手… 難道說
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.87,0:07:42.73,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}ＯＫ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.99,0:07:43.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}答應得好快
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:44.75,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比賽是什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.06,0:07:48.19,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贏了的話真能把幸村老師讓給我們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:50.57,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}暫且是定為明天比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:54.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也和合唱部的人說好了讓她們過來看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.77,0:07:56.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接下來就只能走一步看一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.34,0:07:58.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是不可靠的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.16,0:08:00.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就盡力而為吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:02.63,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陽平 幫我買果汁牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:03.58,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.60,0:08:04.97,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}當我是跑腿的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:07.38,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}籃球是團隊運動吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.47,0:08:12.40,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主從關係…不對 需要好好聽從隊長的命令的僕人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:14.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不對 是部下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.73,0:08:16.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼你是隊長啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.54,0:08:17.36,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}春原
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.75,0:08:19.02,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別阻止我 岡崎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.11,0:08:21.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}籃球和足球都是團隊運動
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.13,0:08:24.05,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以階級社會裡被壓制的關係怎麼可能打得好比賽呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.09,0:08:25.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要的是牛奶咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.35,0:08:27.24,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們的關係也是主從的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:28.32,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事到如今…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.93,0:08:34.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惡 超討厭這種上下關係
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.37,0:08:38.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也 我也想向你提出一個條件
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.65,0:08:39.32,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向我？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.41,0:08:42.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 今天午休的時候陪我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.83,0:08:44.97,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在教室等著 可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.24,0:08:48.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你今天不去活動室嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:51.10,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杏讓我在教室等著
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.91,0:08:55.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼啊 這種反應
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.29,0:08:56.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}智代 你來幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:08:58.87,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有事想和你說說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:00.39,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就坐下了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:04.64,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}據我所知 你好像是遲到的慣犯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.87,0:09:07.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我作為朋友可不能不管
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:10.58,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是三年級學生的話就拿出一點自覺來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.03,0:09:12.90,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼了 和你沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.05,0:09:14.60,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別在意我 吃你的東西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.64,0:09:15.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.87,0:09:18.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要突然衝過來 手會自然動作的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.57,0:09:21.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼我們非要和你在一起吃飯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.49,0:09:22.73,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不會對你怎麼樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:23.99,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是已經這樣了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.30,0:09:28.15,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看啊 他們把低年級的女生帶進來吃飯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.32,0:09:29.34,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是大膽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:31.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是誰的女朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.51,0:09:35.32,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別誤會 我對春原這種人沒興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:37.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「春原這種人」真對不住你了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.59,0:09:40.66,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是來見春原的 而是岡崎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.07,0:09:44.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為他遲到太多了 所以我想來向他提點意見
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.27,0:09:47.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說 你在別人的班級裡幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:51.82,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}應該沒有不能在別人的班級裡吃飯這條校規
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.86,0:09:54.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不能因此而吵吵鬧鬧的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:56.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想一下給周圍的人帶來的困擾啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.89,0:09:58.44,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼你這麼生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:01.91,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}難道說 你喜歡岡崎嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.95,0:10:06.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什…怎…怎麼可能 真荒唐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.93,0:10:09.42,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你現在有交往的對象嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:11.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才沒有 怎麼會說到這個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:12.27,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:16.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那即使這樣和你在一起也沒有會因此感到不高興的女生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:17.33,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.37,0:10:19.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 真是的 總之
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.23,0:10:22.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他和我之前已經約好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.32,0:10:23.33,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.33,0:10:26.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明明已經約好了一起吃午飯的 你還擅自去買麵包吃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.49,0:10:27.60,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 我們走了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:30.48,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之前說的要我陪你是要我陪你吃午飯的意思嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.54,0:10:31.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:35.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接下來才要說正事的 真遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.47,0:10:38.65,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不會是對岡崎有意思吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:40.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我並沒這麼想過
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.07,0:10:47.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是嗎 說不定這就是那種心情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.66,0:10:54.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這到底是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:56.78,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偶爾也陪陪我們嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.95,0:11:00.44,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為你總是和渚以及琴美一起吃午飯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.79,0:11:03.97,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 如果覺得困擾的話 也不必勉強…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.01,0:11:06.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 倒也沒覺得有什麼困擾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.63,0:11:08.08,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.59,0:11:11.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也 你剛才說了件有趣的事情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.65,0:11:13.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有趣的是春原和智代
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.02,0:11:16.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說的不是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:18.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是指你沒有在交往的對象這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.83,0:11:22.19,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和渚並不是男女朋友的關係呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:24.20,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以說 這到底怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:27.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}誰知道呢 到底怎麼了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.98,0:11:58.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芽衣那傢伙 真的說要來看比賽嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:02.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 不管怎麼說 她還是在擔心著你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.75,0:12:03.79,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}誰知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:06.41,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天不是完全沒出現過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.85,0:12:09.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕是想著老哥隨便怎麼樣也無所謂了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.34,0:12:11.43,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼嘛 因為被丟下不管而慪氣？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:13.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定只是過來玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:16.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為她以前就很憧憬著都市
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.37,0:12:17.98,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這裡算不上都市吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:20.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我的鄉下老家比起來已經是都市了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.09,0:12:24.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不過 總比被死纏著要輕鬆多了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.35,0:12:27.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說你啊 那份寂寞都寫在臉上了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.49,0:12:29.58,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:30.75,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說到曹操曹操到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.07,0:12:32.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:34.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她來幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.91,0:12:40.41,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎哥 你果然在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.87,0:12:41.43,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:46.98,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 早苗阿姨和秋生叔叔讓我來叫岡崎哥去吃晚飯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:48.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還有 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.53,0:12:49.83,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯嗯 什麼事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.87,0:12:52.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這個很礙事 所以放你這裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.61,0:12:53.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再見
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:12:59.58,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太過分了 太過分了 太過分了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:04.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}聽好了 今天的比賽一定要贏哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.86,0:13:06.58,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你還真有幹勁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:07.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}發生什麼了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:12.90,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像被籃球部的人說了什麼失禮的話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:13.58,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:18.03,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「和那種最底層的傢伙混在一起 你也墮落了呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.21,0:13:20.26,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是火大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.59,0:13:23.92,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也 把球砸對方鼻子上算犯規？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:25.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 是犯規
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.98,0:13:26.60,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:28.87,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小杏 好大的氣勢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.91,0:13:31.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這下子輸掉的話 可不是隨便就能算了的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:33.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然還是找錯人了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.18,0:13:34.90,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:37.81,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請千萬不要受傷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:39.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用擔心 就看我的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.71,0:13:43.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼籃球部要和演劇部比賽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:45.27,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然不知道為什麼 但不是很有趣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.73,0:13:48.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理恵 為什麼我們一定要看這場比賽呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:53.56,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些人就算在籃球上贏了 和我們又有什麼關係呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:13:55.44,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖說是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.17,0:13:58.77,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但有人拜託我一定要來看這場比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.81,0:13:59.95,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們是幾年級的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.99,0:14:01.33,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全部都是一年級的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:03.97,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼 對手全是一年級的小子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.01,0:14:07.39,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}當然了 和主力隊員打的話 還能算比賽麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.89,0:14:10.20,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那份悠閒 看你還能持續多久
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.25,0:14:12.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比賽是三對三 時間為二十分鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.13,0:14:14.42,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒有暫停
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:17.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他的都按籃球規則來 沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:19.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣做沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:21.57,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果被擔任顧問的大上知道了 會很麻煩的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.78,0:14:23.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果對手是你的話 沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.90,0:14:27.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 渚姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:29.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 請問有什麼事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.17,0:14:31.62,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以待在這裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.87,0:14:35.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒關係的 大家都關注著球場
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.37,0:14:37.73,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒有人會注意到這邊的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.93,0:14:40.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請問 這位是？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.81,0:14:43.40,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是春原陽平的妹妹芽衣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:45.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我哥哥受你們照顧了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.82,0:14:47.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪裡的話 我們才是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.03,0:14:50.17,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請多多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.57,0:14:53.82,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家 比賽就要開始了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.00,0:15:06.92,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 好快
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:09.26,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}春原
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.99,0:15:10.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:17.64,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}進了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.30,0:15:19.26,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做得好 杏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:22.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不愧是經常拿字典砸我們的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.87,0:15:24.34,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快給我翻記分牌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:25.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.23,0:15:28.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}剛才的能得三分嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.00,0:15:34.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普通的投籃能得兩分 但從遠處投進的話能得三分
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.44,0:15:37.34,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我還不知道的說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.43,0:15:41.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哼 碰巧的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.51,0:15:46.76,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒法突破盯防
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.33,0:15:47.78,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.17,0:15:53.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}春原
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.47,0:15:55.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.10,0:16:01.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}進了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.45,0:16:02.73,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杏 投得漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.55,0:16:04.34,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.05,0:16:06.62,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對這傢伙進行緊逼盯防
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:08.20,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呵 就知道會成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.25,0:16:09.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.14,0:16:09.62,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}春原
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:11.99,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不會讓你隨便投籃的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.86,0:16:17.71,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}進了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.72,0:16:18.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好球 春原
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.59,0:16:22.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一年級的 不要以為對手是門外漢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.11,0:16:24.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}給我盡全力去比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.39,0:16:25.16,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:27.93,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主力隊員遲早會被換上場的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.45,0:16:31.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}關鍵是在那之前 能拉開多少比分
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.80,0:16:41.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.62,0:16:46.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要在意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:51.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些人好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.97,0:16:51.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8\fs56}不錯 再來一個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.93,0:16:52.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8\fs56}喂 在這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.08,0:16:54.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明明對方是籃球部的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.56,0:16:55.42,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8\fs56}不錯 杏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.66,0:16:56.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8\fs56}做得好朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:16:57.45,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加油上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:16:59.08,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杏 快投籃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.26,0:17:01.85,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.14,0:17:04.02,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杏姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.80,0:17:06.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加油 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:07.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.11,0:17:12.05,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在低年級的女生中 人氣莫名地高
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.98,0:17:15.75,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎的右手沒法抬過肩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.85,0:17:14.57,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8\fs56}陽平 傳這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.65,0:17:15.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8\fs56}接住了 杏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.60,0:17:16.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8\fs56}快投籃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.21,0:17:18.03,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8\fs56}啊 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.90,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要注意他從左側的持球上籃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:20.47,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這傢伙就可以擺平
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.99,0:17:24.02,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後對剩下的春原和藤林施加壓力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:26.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就能徹底地封殺他們的行動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.43,0:17:21.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8\fs56}陽平 後面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.50,0:17:26.27,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8\fs56}杏 快投籃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:28.63,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成功啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:29.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}換人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.08,0:17:31.47,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一年級的 全給我下來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:32.91,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:35.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒事 看我們的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.48,0:17:37.68,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}終於換上了主力隊員
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:39.62,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼 正合我意呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:41.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}春原 你還能挺得住嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.73,0:17:44.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒事 這點能算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.44,0:17:50.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還有五分鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:54.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差十一分嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:10.39,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:11.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎能讓你過去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.13,0:18:31.91,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}速攻！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.66,0:18:38.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.90,0:18:43.15,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好厲害的追分
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:45.35,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還是贏不了正牌的隊伍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.75,0:18:47.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還有多少時間？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.47,0:18:49.72,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還有一分二十秒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:50.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8\fs56}回防！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.48,0:18:51.98,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要被追上了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:53.27,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只差一分了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.72,0:18:55.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}春原同學的呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.79,0:18:58.84,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被反超了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.87,0:19:01.40,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還剩下二十秒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.41,0:19:03.26,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家加油
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.85,0:19:05.97,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的耐力也到極限了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.15,0:19:13.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}話說 我為什麼會這麼拚命呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.60,0:19:16.19,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好球
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.32,0:19:17.27,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}賭一把了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:18.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休想
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.67,0:19:24.26,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼可能會贏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.45,0:19:27.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這些傢伙每天都在拚命練習
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.07,0:19:29.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.48,0:19:31.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是懶懶散散地過了兩年
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:34.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}結果早就知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:36.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.27,0:19:39.03,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不該參加這個比賽的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.25,0:19:41.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是自取其辱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:43.85,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自取其辱…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:45.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:46.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}投籃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.32,0:19:55.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.79,0:20:01.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便是這樣的我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.39,0:20:04.19,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也找到了前進的目標
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:14.38,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.33,0:20:25.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贏了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.39,0:20:26.56,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好厲害 好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.82,0:20:32.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.26,0:20:33.81,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.16,0:20:37.05,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是在吵什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.24,0:20:38.47,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}糟糕 是大上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.51,0:20:39.17,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.67,0:20:41.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}眼神不錯嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:43.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是還能做到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.37,0:20:46.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別抬舉我了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.05,0:21:01.24,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多謝大家的照顧了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.50,0:21:03.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果時間再多點就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.16,0:21:08.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸和媽媽說讓你有空再過來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.56,0:21:10.95,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芽衣 哥哥大出風頭了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.81,0:21:15.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然後半顯得十分笨拙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:17.92,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但真的很帥哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.05,0:21:19.13,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.53,0:21:22.10,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這次雖然只能待上一小段時間
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:25.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但以後一定會找一段長的時間過來玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.15,0:21:26.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.51,0:21:28.60,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回去的路上小心點哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.71,0:21:29.58,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.33,0:21:42.27,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走掉了啊 還沒陪她玩夠呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.61,0:21:47.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但已經約定好了 還會再過來玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:54.08,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}合唱部的那些人 會把幸村讓出來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.23,0:21:55.90,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 順其自然吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.10,0:22:01.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧 小杏她們應該在等著我們去開慶祝會
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:02.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 是這樣的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.81,0:22:03.36,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.43,0:22:04.17,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.17,0:22:06.08,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼又是在我那裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.16,0:22:08.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}春原同學不知道的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.10,0:22:09.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.89,0:23:51.68,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去向？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.80,0:23:54.68,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒錯 你畢業之後打算怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.28,0:23:59.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別告訴我說 都三年級了還什麼都沒想過
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:01.39,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你們又是怎麼打算的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.69,0:24:04.62,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想要成為一名幼兒園老師
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.05,0:24:07.72,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我打算去護士學校
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:22.82,OC,,0,0,0,,{\move(960,4.5,960,34.5)\fad(460,425)\be1\1c&H00867469\3c&H00D1C1B5}做了一個夢  一個晶瑩剔透的夢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:30.20,OC,,0,0,0,,{\move(900,12,1020,12)\fad(420,420)\be1\1c&H00867469\3c&H00D1C1B5}一個縹緲卻又永恆的夢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:35.82,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(400,400)\be1\1c&H00867469\3c&H00D1C1B5}如清風般輕聲的話語
