Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.29,0:00:46.99,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H00463E20\3c&H00A1B36E}若是就此飛向天空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.79,0:00:49.26,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H00DF9535\3c&H00F0D9C3}若是就此飛向天空
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.52,0:00:53.02,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,400)\be1\1c&H00DF9535\3c&H00F0D9C3}無論何處都能到達
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.62,0:00:56.56,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(400,500)\be1\1c&H0010431E\3c&H0042BC70}無論何處都能到達
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.59,0:01:02.99,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H00607BAE\3c&H007EB7D6}在那牽繫在一起的雙手間
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.09,0:01:09.63,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H00AB969E\3c&H00C9C1C1}若能尋覓到那小小的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:16.35,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H006177B8\3c&H00C9ACB1}在光芒中搖曳著的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.33,0:01:22.41,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H000E1312\3c&H00A8B0B0}所有話語和思念
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:35.45,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H00566060\3c&H00C5E5F0}都必將 毫無保留地 傳遞給 身在遠方的你
